  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0208_daad18ef1117.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 191px;\" /><br /><br />Charged particle can be considered at centre of a cube of side <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>, and given surface represents its one face. So, flux <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><msub><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#1013;</mi></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></math>."
